                    339.0,
                    806.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The final schedule of vacations shall be posted in the department by March 31. Once scheduled, requests for changes in vacation must be submitted in writing no later than four (4) weeks prior to the original vacation commencement date. Changes shall be considered in light of the number of existing vacations scheduled for the newly requested period, the staffing needs of the Employer, and the nature of the employee's reason for the requested change.",
            "block_bbox": [
                340,
                829,
                1476,
